OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the best of any
OL,7,Fdrier and brighter conditions across
OL,8,FArgyll and the islands during the
OL,9,Fmorning. Winds mostly light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will push
OL,12,Fnorthwards during the evening, heavy
OL,13,Fat times. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,14,Freturning from the west overnight.
OL,15,FBreezy around the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FBright spells and showers,
OL,18,Fthe showers mainly through the
OL,19,Fafternoon and early evening with the
OL,20,Fbest of the sunshine during the
OL,21,Fmorning. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
