OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,7,FFriday, the showers becoming lighter
OL,8,Fand well scattered on Saturday with
OL,9,Feasing winds. Heavy rain expected on
OL,10,FSunday.
